{"abstract":[{"text":"A reusable game system — commerce, combat, dialog, magic — packaged as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"importable unit of ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"verbs","type":"text"}]},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"rules","type":"text"}]},{"text":", that a host game opts into.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/actions","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/command","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/gameText","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/player","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/rules","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/statusFields","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/timers","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/verbs","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/world"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"inheritsFrom"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto"]]},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Composing Large Games","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/SplittingAGameAcrossFiles","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContentBundles","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Plugins","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContents","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ScoreDeclaring"],"anchor":"Composing-Large-Games"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"protocol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GamePlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Protocol","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"externalID":"s:6Gnusto10GamePluginP","title":"GamePlugin","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GamePlugin"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GamePlugin"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/AddingCustomVerbs","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Plugins","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/WritingRules"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A plugin bundles the player-typeable vocabulary a system needs ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"buy"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attack"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ask"},{"type":"text","text":") with the logic that reacts to it, so the system can be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shipped once and reused instead of hand-copied into every game."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct CommercePlugin: GamePlugin {","    static let buy = Intent(\"buy\")","","    var verbs: [SyntaxRule] {","        SyntaxRule(\"buy\", .directObject, intent: Self.buy)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Logic-only-a-plugin-owns-no-state","text":"Logic-only: a plugin owns no state"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" bundle, a plugin’s stored children are not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registered or namespaced by the bootstrap, so it declares no rooms, items,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Global"},{"type":"text","text":" state of its own. It operates entirely over entities and globals"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"host","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" declares, receiving what it needs as parameters. That keeps a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plugin portable: it makes no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assumptions about the host’s world beyond the traits and intents it agrees"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on. A plugin that genuinely needs to ship its own content is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" bundle instead (list it in the game’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The bootstrap enforces that boundary: a stored plugin containing a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Location"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Item"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Actor"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Global"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Latch"},{"type":"text","text":" is rejected before play."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"The host opts in by splicing","level":2,"anchor":"The-host-opts-in-by-splicing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The host stores the plugin as a plain property and splices its vocabulary,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default actions, and rules into its own blocks. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verbs"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actions"},{"type":"text","text":" each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"merge just like a game’s own, and the plugin’s rule factories return"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Rules","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" the host composes in. Together, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verbs"},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actions"},{"type":"text","text":" let a plugin"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ship a whole verb behavior — vocabulary and stage-4 default — without any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host rules at all; a host only needs its own rules to embellish or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"override that default for specific entities."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct LampShop: Game {","    let commerce = CommercePlugin()","    @Global var purse = Purse(coins: 10)","    let lantern = Item { name(\"brass lantern\"); trait(.price, 5) }","","    var verbs: [SyntaxRule] { commerce.verbs }","    var rules: Rules {","        commerce.purchase(of: lantern,","                          balance: { purse.coins },","                          charge:  { purse.coins -= $0 })","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The protocol’s own "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/rules","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" requirement carries only self-contained,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world-scoped rules that need nothing from the host. Rules that must reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host entities are exposed as "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"parameterized methods","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" returning "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Rules","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"purchase(of:balance:charge:)"},{"type":"text","text":" above), which the host calls with its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declarations — every line still readable in the host’s source."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin"]}],"references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/Plugins":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/plugins","title":"Plugins","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Plugins","kind":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Package a reusable game system as an importable unit of verbs and rules.","type":"text"}],"role":"article"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GamePlugin":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A reusable game system — commerce, combat, dialog, magic — packaged as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"importable unit of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"verbs","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"rules","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", that a host game opts into.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GamePlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"GamePlugin","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GamePlugin"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GamePlugin/timers":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/timers","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timers","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"required":true,"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin\/timers","type":"topic","title":"timers","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fuses and daemons the plugin contributes, in the same form as a game’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":". Defaults to empty. The host opts in by splicing:"}],"role":"symbol","defaultImplementations":1,"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameContents":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gamecontents","title":"GameContents","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameContents","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GameContents"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The collected content bundles a game declares, in declaration order.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GameContents"}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GamePlugin/verbs":{"abstract":[{"text":"Player-typeable verbs the plugin contributes, in the same form as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"game’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"verbs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Defaults to empty. Precedence runs built-ins <","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bundles\/plugins < host game, so a host verb of the same shape beats","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this one.","type":"text"}],"defaultImplementations":1,"title":"verbs","kind":"symbol","required":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/verbs","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin\/verbs","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"verbs"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SyntaxRule","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10SyntaxRuleV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GamePlugin/gameText":{"abstract":[{"text":"The stock lines the engine is speaking this turn — usable as a bare","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identifier in a plugin’s rule bodies, exactly as in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Game","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"title":"gameText","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/gameText","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin\/gametext","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"gameText"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","text":"GameText"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/WritingRules":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/WritingRules","abstract":[{"text":"Attach game logic to items, locations, and the world.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"Writing Rules","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/writingrules","role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GamePlugin/actions":{"abstract":[{"text":"Stage-4 default actions the plugin contributes, in the same form as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"game’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"actions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Defaults to empty. Precedence runs built-ins <","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bundles\/plugins < host game, so a host action for the same intent beats","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this one — and this is what lets a plugin’s verbs (like Phase 8’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"combat ","type":"text"},{"code":"attack","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") actually do something by default, not just parse.","type":"text"}],"defaultImplementations":1,"title":"actions","kind":"symbol","required":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin\/actions","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplug